{"html_text": {"ja436:0.1": "<article id='ja436'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja436:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja436:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja436:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja436:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja436:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja436:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja436:4.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja436:5.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:5.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:5.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:5.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja436:6.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:6.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:6.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:6.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja436:7.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:7.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:7.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:7.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja436:8.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:8.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:8.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:8.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja436:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja436:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja436:10.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja436:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja436:0.2": "Navakanipāta ", "ja436:0.3": "Gijjhavagga ", "ja436:0.4": "10. Samuggajātaka ", "ja436:1.1": "“Kuto nu āgacchatha bho tayo janā, ", "ja436:1.2": "Svāgatā etha nisīdathāsane; ", "ja436:1.3": "Kaccittha bhonto kusalaṁ anāmayaṁ, ", "ja436:1.4": "Cirassamabbhāgamanaṁ hi vo idha”. ", "ja436:2.1": "“Ahameva eko idha majja patto, ", "ja436:2.2": "Na cāpi me dutiyo koci vijjati; ", "ja436:2.3": "Kimeva sandhāya te bhāsitaṁ ise, ", "ja436:2.4": "‘Kuto nu āgacchatha bho tayo janā’”. ", "ja436:3.1": "“Tuvañca eko bhariyā ca te piyā, ", "ja436:3.2": "Samuggapakkhittanikiṇṇamantare; ", "ja436:3.3": "Sā rakkhitā kucchigatāva te sadā, ", "ja436:3.4": "Vāyussa puttena sahā tahiṁ ratā”. ", "ja436:4.1": "“Saṁviggarūpo isinā viyākato, ", "ja436:4.2": "So dānavo tattha samuggamuggili; ", "ja436:4.3": "Addakkhi bhariyaṁ suci māladhāriniṁ, ", "ja436:4.4": "Vāyussa puttena sahā tahiṁ rataṁ”. ", "ja436:5.1": "“Sudiṭṭharūpamuggatapānuvattinā, ", "ja436:5.2": "Hīnā narā ye pamadāvasaṁ gatā; ", "ja436:5.3": "Yathā have pāṇarivettha rakkhitā, ", "ja436:5.4": "Duṭṭhā mayī aññamabhippamodayi. ", "ja436:6.1": "Divā ca ratto ca mayā upaṭṭhitā, ", "ja436:6.2": "Tapassinā jotirivā vane vasaṁ; ", "ja436:6.3": "Sā dhammamukkamma adhammamācari, ", "ja436:6.4": "Akiriyarūpo pamadāhi santhavo. ", "ja436:7.1": "Sarīramajjhamhi ṭhitātimaññahaṁ, ", "ja436:7.2": "Mayhaṁ ayanti asatiṁ asaññataṁ; ", "ja436:7.3": "Sā dhammamukkamma adhammamācari, ", "ja436:7.4": "Akiriyarūpo pamadāhi santhavo. ", "ja436:8.1": "Surakkhitaṁ meti kathaṁ nu vissase, ", "ja436:8.2": "Anekacittāsu na hatthi rakkhaṇā; ", "ja436:8.3": "Etā hi pātālapapātasannibhā, ", "ja436:8.4": "Etthappamatto byasanaṁ nigaccha”ti. ", "ja436:9.1": "“Tasmā hi te sukhino vītasokā, ", "ja436:9.2": "Ye mātugāmehi caranti nissaṭā; ", "ja436:9.3": "Etaṁ sivaṁ uttamamābhipatthayaṁ, ", "ja436:9.4": "Na mātugāmehi kareyya santhavanti”. ", "ja436:10.1": "Samuggajātakaṁ dasamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja436:0.1": "", "ja436:0.2": "", "ja436:0.3": "", "ja436:0.4": "", "ja436:1.1": "", "ja436:1.2": "Svāgatā etha → svāgataṁ ettha (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja436:1.3": "", "ja436:1.4": "", "ja436:2.1": "", "ja436:2.2": "", "ja436:2.3": "", "ja436:2.4": "", "ja436:3.1": "", "ja436:3.2": "", "ja436:3.3": "kucchigatāva → kucchigatā ca (mr) ", "ja436:3.4": "Vāyussa → harissa (mr) ", "ja436:4.1": "viyākato → byākato (sya1ed, sya2ed); vyākato (pts-vp-pli1); pabyākato (mr) ", "ja436:4.2": "", "ja436:4.3": "", "ja436:4.4": "", "ja436:5.1": "Sudiṭṭharūpamuggatapānuvattinā → sudiṭṭharūpuggatapānuvattinā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); suddiṭṭharūpuggatapānuvattinā (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja436:5.2": "", "ja436:5.3": "", "ja436:5.4": "", "ja436:6.1": "", "ja436:6.2": "", "ja436:6.3": "", "ja436:6.4": "", "ja436:7.1": "", "ja436:7.2": "", "ja436:7.3": "", "ja436:7.4": "", "ja436:8.1": "", "ja436:8.2": "Anekacittāsu na hatthi → anekacittāsu na hettha (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); anekacittā puna hettha (mr) ", "ja436:8.3": "", "ja436:8.4": "", "ja436:9.1": "", "ja436:9.2": "", "ja436:9.3": "", "ja436:9.4": "", "ja436:10.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja436:0.1": "", "ja436:0.2": "", "ja436:0.3": "", "ja436:0.4": "", "ja436:1.1": "bj30.342, ms22J_1876, msdiv87, pts-vp-pli3.528", "ja436:1.2": "", "ja436:1.3": "", "ja436:1.4": "", "ja436:2.1": "ms22J_1877, msdiv88, ndp22.189, pts-vp-pli3.529", "ja436:2.2": "", "ja436:2.3": "", "ja436:2.4": "", "ja436:3.1": "dr27.265, ms22J_1878, msdiv89, sya27.266", "ja436:3.2": "", "ja436:3.3": "", "ja436:3.4": "", "ja436:4.1": "csp1ed22.197, csp2ed22.197, ms22J_1879, msdiv90, pts-vp-pli3.530", "ja436:4.2": "", "ja436:4.3": "", "ja436:4.4": "", "ja436:5.1": "ms22J_1880, msdiv91", "ja436:5.2": "", "ja436:5.3": "", "ja436:5.4": "", "ja436:6.1": "ms22J_1881, msdiv92", "ja436:6.2": "", "ja436: